⍝ ==== s2 lexer driver: print the token dump of a file, like trithc --tokens

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,count,rem
  ⧗:path ⎙̵ $: error: imbalance: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:count ᛁ $ tokens, $ ⎙̵ ⧗:rem ᛁ $ too many for the Ternary Balance Law\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:out ⌁̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹imbal› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out
  ⧗:out ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:count ⧖:out
  ⧗:count #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ #3# ⊞ ⦄ ⧖:rem
  ⧗:path,out,count,rem
  ⧗:rem ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⟗ ‹dump› ⌁̵ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹imbal› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹main3› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,src
  ⧗:src ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:cps ⌁̵
  ⧗:path ⟗ ⧗:cps ‹lexw› ⁇ ⦃ ‹main3› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹main2› ⸫

⦃
  ⟗ ᚠ ⁇
    ⦃ ⟗ ⍴̱ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
    ⦃ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹main1› ⸫

⦃
  △ ᚨ ⁇ ⦃ ‹main1› ⦄ ⦃ $usage: s2lex <file.trh>\n$ ⎙̵ #2# ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
